  "description": "Visible indexed SSH target is absent from the runtime store: list and single return the indexed row with login_hint omitted, never unavailable. No synchronization-lag enum or index-derived matching fallback. Each named target has an exclusive tag equal to its id; filtered list reads select that row for the field-omission checks.",
